    "title": "Describe an impression from appearance",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-appearance-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Describe an impression from appearance",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "看起来 and 看上去 followed by a description mean looks or seems. They report an impression, which may change when you learn more; they are not a guarantee of the thing’s real quality.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这本书看起来很旧。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū kànqǐlai hěn jiù 。",
                "meaning": "This book looks old.",
                "audio": "20d731580233829dbda7b05f3fd3a6493c7077b0aab824472d096a01367794fe"
              },
              {
                "text": "这本书看上去很好。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū kànshangqu hěn hǎo 。",
                "meaning": "This book looks good.",
                "audio": "ed6839de69c01dfd65290220b7607cb6307c0c4cc51121cd1871389245fe321f"
              }
